          <p class="lede">On-site clinics, on-demand telehealth, and a dedicated care team that brings India's best doctors directly to your office — without ever pulling employees away from work.</p>
          <div class="cta-row">
            <a class="btn btn-primary" href="mailto:Sales@anara.health">Get a Quote <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
