            <strong>85%+</strong>
            <span>Typical participation, vs &lt;40% industry avg</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="g-about-glass">
          <span class="eyebrow">The Anara Difference</span>
          <h2 id="about-title">Most health vendors deliver below 50% participation. Anara is different.</h2>
          <p>Other vendors expect employees to go find the care themselves. Anara brings doctors and nurses to your
            office for blood tests, full health checks, and follow-up clinics — then follows up with every employee
            personally on WhatsApp. The result: 85%+ participation, real action plans per person, and a population
            report your global team will quote in a board meeting.</p>
          <a class="link-arrow" href="#services">Explore service packages <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- WHY ANARA -->
    <section id="why" class="g-why" aria-labelledby="why-title">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-head reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">Why Anara</span>
          <h2 id="why-title">Four reasons India HR Directors pick Anara over conventional corporate health plans.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="g-why-grid">
          <article class="g-glass-card is-feature">
            <span class="num" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
            <h3>Participation is the gap. We come on-site and fix that.</h3>
            <p>Anara clinics typically see 85%+ participation, far beyond what other vendors deliver. The difference is
              operational: we come to your office and see employees during their working day. No commute. No leave. No
              excuses.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="g-glass-card">
            <span class="num" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
            <h3>Every employee gets a follow-up. Personally. On WhatsApp.</h3>
            <p>After the clinic, our doctors send a personalised summary and action plan to every employee. No one is
              left to figure it out alone. Short of putting the pill in their mouth, this is the closest thing to
              closing the loop.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="g-glass-card">
            <span class="num" aria-hidden="true">03</span>
            <h3>We run the program. Your HR team doesn't.</h3>
            <p>Scheduling, employee communications, lab coordination, reporting — Anara handles all of it. Your HR
              team's job is to approve the date and share the employee list. We take the full administrative burden off
              your plate.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="g-glass-card">
            <span class="num" aria-hidden="true">04</span>
            <h3>No new budget line. Works through your GMC.</h3>
            <p>We work directly with your company, your TPA, and your broker so the engagement structures into your
              existing OPD reimbursement. No extra approvals. No new procurement category. Finance doesn't see a new
              line item.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

