    <!-- SERVICES -->
    <section id="services" class="g-services" aria-labelledby="services-title">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-head g-section-head-light reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">Service Packages</span>
          <h2 id="services-title">Four service lines. Each one a specific product — not a category.</h2>
          <p class="section-sub">Framed around the employer's pain point first, clinical outcome second. Start with one
            or combine them into a full program.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="g-services-grid">
          <a class="g-glass-card g-service-card" href="#cta">
            <div class="g-service-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"
                stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M3 9 L12 3 L21 9 V20 a1 1 0 0 1-1 1 H4 a1 1 0 0 1-1-1 Z" />
                <path d="M12 12 v6 M9 15 h6" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <span class="g-svc-tag">Package 01</span>
            <h3>Employee Health Checks — On-Site Blood Tests + Doctor Visit</h3>
            <p>We run a full health-check clinic at your office, on a date you pick. Our doctors screen for the
              conditions that are quietly costing you the most — hypertension, diabetes, weight, nutrition, skin, lung,
              thyroid, mental wellbeing, and more. After the clinic, you receive a population health report with
              anonymous reporting on employee health and improvement over time.</p>
            <p class="g-svc-yield"><strong>What you get:</strong> Population health report. Individual employee
              summaries. Year-on-year trend data. A program your global HQ can point to.</p>
            <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </a>
          <a class="g-glass-card g-service-card" href="#cta">
            <div class="g-service-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"
                stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M12 21 s-7-4.35-7-11 a5 5 0 0 1 9-3 a5 5 0 0 1 9 3 c0 6.65-7 11-7 11z" />
                <path d="M3.5 12 H8 l2-3 l3 6 l2-3 h5.5" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <span class="g-svc-tag">Package 02</span>
            <h3>Executive Health — Dedicated Sessions for Senior Leadership <span class="g-svc-tier">Executive
                tier</span></h3>
            <p><em>Ideal for: CXO, VP, and director-level cohorts where a standard health check isn't enough.</em> We
              send a dedicated Anara doctor to your office for one-on-one sessions with each senior leader.
              Cardiovascular risk profiling, executive stress assessment, full blood panel, and a private 1:1
              consultation. No waiting room. Full confidentiality. A 12-month preventive plan per leader, with direct
              doctor access between sessions.</p>
            <p class="g-svc-yield"><strong>What you get:</strong> Individual executive health summaries. A 12-month
              preventive plan per leader. Confidential 1:1 follow-up access on WhatsApp.</p>
            <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </a>
          <a class="g-glass-card g-service-card" href="#cta">
            <div class="g-service-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"
                stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M3 11 L12 3 L21 11" />
                <path d="M5 9 V21 H19 V9" />
                <path d="M10 21 V14 H14 V21" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <span class="g-svc-tag">Package 03</span>
            <h3>Elder Care — Parents and Dependents at Home</h3>
            <p><em>Ideal for: Employers whose GMC covers parents under a family plan.</em> India's family insurance
              covers parents — most insurers stop there. Anara offers a trained Care Manager for home visits or
              on-demand telehealth for the employee's parents. We manage medications, accompany to hospital
              appointments, coordinate labs, and send real-time updates to the employee.</p>
            <p class="g-svc-yield"><strong>What you get:</strong> Measurably lower employee stress and absenteeism. A
              benefit your people will mention at every offer negotiation.</p>
            <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </a>
          <a class="g-glass-card g-service-card" href="#cta">
            <div class="g-service-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"
                stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" />
                <path d="M3 12 H21 M12 3 a14 14 0 0 1 0 18 a14 14 0 0 1 0-18" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <span class="g-svc-tag">Add-Ons</span>
            <h3>Year-Round Programs — Keep Wellness Visible Beyond the Annual Check.</h3>
            <p><em>Ideal for: Employers who want year-round access and measurable trend data.</em> Women's health
              programs, vaccination drives, chronic-condition clinics, mental health sessions, and specialist seminars —
              delivered on the same on-site model so participation stays high all year, not just in the month of the
              annual clinic.</p>
            <p class="g-svc-yield"><strong>What you get:</strong> Year-on-year population health trends. A story you can
              tell at global health and wellness reviews.</p>
            <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
