                stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M5 12 H19" />
              </svg>
              <div><strong>We don't take on engagements under 200 employees.</strong><span>Our model needs scale to keep
                  the per-employee cost inside OPD budgets and the clinical pod fully utilised.</span></div>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- PROCESS -->
    <section id="process" class="g-process" aria-labelledby="process-title">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-head g-section-head-light reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">How It Works</span>
          <h2 id="process-title">From your first call to a population health report — in four steps.</h2>
          <p class="section-sub">Operational and honest. Here's exactly what partnering with Anara looks like, week to
            week.</p>
        </div>
        <ol class="g-process-grid">
          <li class="g-glass-card g-step">
            <span class="g-step-num" aria-hidden="true">1</span>
            <h3>Pick a date</h3>
            <p>You tell us when works for your site. We handle everything else — equipment, doctors, setup, and employee
              communications.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="g-glass-card g-step">
            <span class="g-step-num" aria-hidden="true">2</span>
            <h3>We run the clinic on-site</h3>
            <p>Our doctors come to your office and run a full health check. 85%+ of your employees participate, because
              they don't have to go anywhere.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="g-glass-card g-step">
            <span class="g-step-num" aria-hidden="true">3</span>
            <h3>Every employee gets a WhatsApp follow-up</h3>
            <p>Within 48 hours, each employee receives their personal results and a specific action plan from their
              doctor. Clear, private, actionable.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="g-glass-card g-step">
            <span class="g-step-num" aria-hidden="true">4</span>
            <h3>You get a population health report</h3>
            <p>Anara delivers an anonymised summary of your workforce's health trends — benchmarked, formatted, ready
              for global stakeholders.</p>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>

