                d="M4.98 3.5C4.98 4.88 3.87 6 2.5 6S0 4.88 0 3.5 1.11 1 2.5 1s2.48 1.12 2.48 2.5zM.22 8h4.56v14H.22V8zm7.36 0h4.37v1.92h.06c.61-1.15 2.1-2.36 4.33-2.36 4.63 0 5.49 3.05 5.49 7.02V22h-4.57v-6.59c0-1.57-.03-3.6-2.2-3.6-2.2 0-2.54 1.72-2.54 3.49V22H7.58V8z" />
